---
title: "Sequence Diagram - Moderate a Story Submission"
config:
  theme: neutral
  themeVariables:
    background: '#ffffff'
    noteBkgColor: '#ffffff'
    noteBorderColor: '#999999'
    noteTextColor: '#000000'
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor SP as Specialist
  participant W as Web App
  participant R as :ModerationRoutes
  participant C as :PublishingController
  participant PS as :PublishingService
  participant PR as :PublishRules
  participant NST as :StoriesNarrationStore
  participant MS as :MonitoringService
  participant DB as Database

  Note over SP,DB: 1. Open queue and claim a submission
  SP->>W: Open moderation queue
  W->>R: GET /api/v1/moderation/submissions
  R->>R: auth, authorize(specialist, admin)
  R->>C: getQueue(req, res)
  C->>PS: getQueue(moderator)
  PS->>DB: SELECT undecided moderation_reviews + listing, seller, page count
  C-->>W: 200 queue
  SP->>W: Click Review on a submission
  W->>R: POST /api/v1/moderation/submissions/:reviewId/claim
  R->>C: claimReview(req, res)
  C->>PS: claimReview(moderator, reviewId)
  PS->>DB: BEGIN, SELECT moderation_reviews FOR UPDATE
  PS->>PR: claimedByOther(review, moderatorId, now)
  alt already decided / claimed by another specialist
    PS-->>C: ApiError 409 (rollback)
    C-->>W: 409 Already decided / being reviewed
  else free
    PS->>NST: loadReadiness(publishedStoryId)
    alt narration still generating or failed
      PS-->>C: ApiError 409 (rollback)
      C-->>W: 409 Narration not ready
    else ready
      PS->>DB: UPDATE moderation_reviews SET moderatorId, claimExpiresAt = now + 30 min
      PS->>DB: UPDATE listings SET in_review (if submitted), COMMIT
      PS->>DB: SELECT published story detail, page views
      PS->>PR: reviewProgress(pageIds, viewedIds)
      C-->>W: 200 review detail + progress
    end
  end

  Note over SP,DB: 2. Read every page
  loop each page
    SP->>W: Open page (optional comment)
    W->>R: POST /api/v1/moderation/submissions/:reviewId/pages/:pageId/view {comment?}
    R->>C: viewPage(req, res)
    C->>PS: viewPage(moderator, reviewId, pageId, body)
    alt claim expired / not the claimer / page not in story
      PS-->>C: ApiError 409 / 404
      C-->>W: error
    else ok
      PS->>DB: UPSERT review_page_views (viewedAt, comment)
      C-->>W: 200 updated progress
    end
  end

  Note over SP,DB: 3. Decide
  SP->>W: Choose decision (+ comment, issue strike?)
  W->>R: POST /api/v1/moderation/submissions/:reviewId/decision {decision, comment?, issueStrike?}
  R->>C: decide(req, res)
  C->>PS: decide(moderator, reviewId, body)
  PS->>DB: BEGIN, load review, check claim
  PS->>DB: SELECT pages of published story
  PS->>PR: reviewProgress(pageIds, viewedIds)
  alt decision not allowed for this review type
    PS-->>C: ApiError 422
    C-->>W: 422 Invalid decision
  else approved but pages not all viewed / narration not ready
    PS-->>C: ApiError 422 / 409
    C-->>W: 422 View all pages first / 409 narration
  else not approved and no comment
    PS-->>C: ApiError 422
    C-->>W: 422 Comment is required
  else valid
    PS->>DB: UPDATE moderation_reviews SET decision, comment, decidedAt
    PS->>DB: UPDATE listings SET status (approved = published, changes_requested, rejected, taken_down = archived)
    opt approved submission of a new version
      PS->>DB: move entitlements, product_reviews, bookshelf items, counters to new listing, old listing archived
    end
    opt follow-up review (report / random audit)
      PS->>MS: closeOpenReports(tx, moderatorId, listingId, decision)
    end
    opt taken_down, or rejected with issueStrike
      PS->>MS: issueStrikeTx(tx, moderatorId, seller)
      MS->>DB: INSERT creator_strikes, suspend seller at strike limit
    end
    PS->>DB: COMMIT
    C-->>W: 200 decision saved
    W-->>SP: Back to queue
  end
